      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELEVENTH SCOTCH (1) did a good job to finish third last time out over 390m at this track (22.60) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot. Will find this more suitable and can atone. BRAGGING RIGHTS (3) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Filled a minor placings again last time when third (22.53) at Warrnambool making it three placings in a row. Overdue and is among the main hopes. ROLLING EXPRESS (7) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at Healesville over 350m behind Noble Shadow (19.92) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Cannot be left out. PAW RIVAL (6) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
